WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 20=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:41.959 --> 01:44.960
I'm willing to take Xiuwan's place

01:45.200 --> 01:46.559
and marry into the Yuan family.

01:50.400 --> 01:53.119
Was this your own idea,

01:53.439 --> 01:55.199
or did Jinqi put you up to it?

02:01.519 --> 02:03.080
I went to Jinqi and told him

02:03.640 --> 02:05.800
Xiuwan didn't want
to marry into the Marquis's family,

02:05.840 --> 02:06.839
but I did.

02:10.840 --> 02:13.000
The way you usually are,

02:13.159 --> 02:15.400
you've never been this assertive.

02:18.639 --> 02:20.120
You're right, Grandfather.

02:21.000 --> 02:23.600
I've always been timid,

02:23.879 --> 02:25.239
afraid to take any chances.

02:26.400 --> 02:28.000
But lately,

02:28.319 --> 02:29.679
I keep thinking about

02:29.680 --> 02:31.680
a maid who served Jinqi.

02:32.039 --> 02:33.400
Her name is Lanxiang.

02:34.439 --> 02:36.680
She was merely a lowly servant,

02:36.840 --> 02:39.239
yet she dared to fight
for what she wanted.

02:39.470 --> 02:40.904
In the end, she got her wish,

02:40.936 --> 02:43.290
and all three members of her family
became free commoners.

02:43.360 --> 02:44.639
No matter how you look at it,

02:45.159 --> 02:46.680
I have more advantages than she did.

02:47.360 --> 02:49.119
If she dared to fight
for what she wanted,

02:49.120 --> 02:50.560
why shouldn't I?

02:51.630 --> 02:53.128
I can't compare with Xiuwan.

02:53.130 --> 02:53.990
I could never hope for

02:54.000 --> 02:55.950
a marriage as good
as this one with the Yuan family.

02:55.960 --> 02:58.640
But now that I have the chance
to marry into such a prominent family,

02:58.650 --> 02:59.720
I want to fight for it too.

03:01.759 --> 03:03.280
I want to marry into the Yuan family

03:03.639 --> 03:05.000
and become the Marchioness.

03:05.639 --> 03:07.799
I don't want to spend my life
afraid to take a chance.

03:08.104 --> 03:10.030
I want to live
a life of wealth and privilege.

03:10.039 --> 03:12.339
♪In spring, my heart
sets out filled with hope♪

03:12.340 --> 03:15.140
♪For all the tenderness in this world♪

03:16.620 --> 03:18.259
♪My heart brimming with anticipation♪

03:18.260 --> 03:22.638
♪Like an orchid in a secluded valley,
growing toward the sun♪

03:22.639 --> 03:24.720
The Yuan family
is of distinguished standing.

03:25.599 --> 03:28.280
The first Marchioness
was a Commandery Princess.

03:28.639 --> 03:31.038
I had thought Xiuwan

03:31.039 --> 03:33.880
was forthright and confident
from a young age,

03:33.976 --> 03:36.808
so I wouldn't have to worry
about her being taken advantage of.

03:37.319 --> 03:39.880
You've always been timid,

03:40.159 --> 03:43.320
so I feared you couldn't
manage the Marquis's household.

03:44.599 --> 03:46.758
But after hearing what you've just said,

03:46.759 --> 03:49.478
I see that you know what you want

03:49.479 --> 03:51.199
and can adapt to circumstances.

03:51.400 --> 03:53.799
You're more suitable than Xiuwan.

03:57.319 --> 03:58.239
However,

03:58.439 --> 04:01.680
we still need to ask
the Yuan family what they think.

04:03.639 --> 04:05.560
After Xiuru spoke to me,

04:05.719 --> 04:07.320
I apologized to Yuan

04:07.479 --> 04:09.000
and asked what he thought.

04:09.599 --> 04:11.999
He said he only wished to form

04:12.000 --> 04:13.560
a marriage alliance with the Lin family

04:13.759 --> 04:16.280
and didn't care which branch
the young lady came from.

04:17.319 --> 04:19.399
Then we'll do as you wish.

04:23.240 --> 04:24.360
Jinqi.

04:27.759 --> 04:29.279
Grandfather agreed.

04:35.720 --> 04:37.320
From today onward,

04:37.519 --> 04:39.800
Xiuwan is confined
to Huaqiong Courtyard.

04:40.319 --> 04:42.079
Without my permission,

04:42.399 --> 04:45.079
she is not to set foot outside her room.

04:47.800 --> 04:49.839
It's all right.

04:56.160 --> 04:57.759
Xiuwan, bear with it for now.

04:58.360 --> 04:59.759
Once Grandfather's anger subsides,

05:00.000 --> 05:01.320
we'll think of a way.

05:01.800 --> 05:03.360
Jinqi is right.

05:03.959 --> 05:06.360
Once six months or a year has passed,

05:06.480 --> 05:08.519
we can consider what to do next.

05:09.519 --> 05:11.159
I'll do as you say.

05:12.839 --> 05:15.159
I'll do as you say.

05:24.780 --> 05:27.860
(Yongshun Bookshop)

05:29.639 --> 05:30.878
Of the houses we saw before,

05:30.879 --> 05:32.758
some were too expensive for you,

05:32.759 --> 05:34.679
some were too old for you,

05:34.680 --> 05:36.679
and some had neighbors you didn't like.

05:36.680 --> 05:38.040
They were all men.

05:38.360 --> 05:41.039
It's mainly because our family is small.

05:41.040 --> 05:42.919
We have only one daughter

05:42.920 --> 05:44.880
and no relatives nearby to help us.

05:45.079 --> 05:45.958
If we happen to get

05:45.959 --> 05:47.639
a difficult neighbor,

05:47.759 --> 05:49.000
we may not be able to handle it.

05:50.120 --> 05:51.638
Your daughter is a fine young lady.

05:51.639 --> 05:53.440
You're right to be cautious.

05:53.480 --> 05:54.670
I guarantee you'll be pleased

05:54.680 --> 05:56.000
with the house we're seeing today.

05:57.120 --> 05:58.040
Here we are.

06:05.920 --> 06:07.360
Come in.

06:07.639 --> 06:09.199
Please, come in.

06:09.439 --> 06:10.839
Go ahead and have a look around.

06:13.839 --> 06:16.560
This place is close
to the Central City Patrol Office.

06:16.600 --> 06:17.740
At the slightest disturbance,

06:17.816 --> 06:19.470
the patrolmen
will come by to investigate.

06:19.480 --> 06:22.320
You won't have
to worry about safety at all.

06:22.560 --> 06:24.518
Most of the neighbors
are scholarly families.

06:24.520 --> 06:25.688
Even if you don't get along,

06:25.720 --> 06:27.110
you can simply keep your distance.

06:27.120 --> 06:28.959
Surely it wouldn't lead to any trouble.

06:30.240 --> 06:32.560
The rent on this house
can't be cheap, can it?

06:33.439 --> 06:35.199
As for the annual rent,

06:36.360 --> 06:37.480
it's this much.

06:38.600 --> 06:39.839
Fifty taels?

06:41.240 --> 06:41.958
Five hundred?

06:41.959 --> 06:43.040
Five taels.

06:44.600 --> 06:45.880
Five taels?

06:46.079 --> 06:47.199
Five taels?

06:53.120 --> 06:56.240
This house is in a good location
and in excellent condition.

06:56.270 --> 06:58.616
How could the annual rent
possibly be only five taels?

06:58.792 --> 07:01.640
The owner used to be a ceremonial usher
at the Court of State Ceremonies.

07:01.688 --> 07:04.540
After retiring and returning to
his hometown, he left the house vacant.

07:04.920 --> 07:06.878
He isn't looking to charge much rent.

07:06.879 --> 07:08.838
He just wants someone
to look after the house

07:08.839 --> 07:10.399
and keep it from falling into disrepair.

07:12.839 --> 07:15.239
The annual rent
really is only five taels?

07:15.240 --> 07:16.759
It really is.

07:17.759 --> 07:18.680
Look.

07:18.920 --> 07:20.839
I even brought the lease with me.

07:21.240 --> 07:22.758
Once you sign it,

07:22.759 --> 07:25.320
you can move in immediately.

07:28.040 --> 07:28.679
Then let's...

07:28.680 --> 07:30.240
Let's hurry and sign it.

07:33.100 --> 07:35.380
(House Lease)

07:36.920 --> 07:37.959
Father.

07:44.920 --> 07:46.240
Let's keep looking.

07:46.800 --> 07:47.318
Yes.

07:47.319 --> 07:48.359
Let's keep looking.

07:48.360 --> 07:49.638
Keep looking.

07:49.639 --> 07:50.639
Let's keep looking.

07:51.519 --> 07:52.599
Such a fine house

07:52.600 --> 07:53.878
at such a low price.

07:53.879 --> 07:56.279
What more is there to look for?

07:57.560 --> 07:58.800
Let's keep looking.

08:00.240 --> 08:02.518
What exactly are you unhappy with?

08:02.519 --> 08:04.278
With a house like this at this price,

08:04.279 --> 08:05.359
it's an incredible bargain.

08:05.360 --> 08:07.320
Why would you turn it down?

08:07.720 --> 08:09.078
If it's such an incredible bargain,

08:09.079 --> 08:11.000
why don't you take it, Broker Liu?

08:12.430 --> 08:13.464
A house this good

08:13.496 --> 08:15.750
would normally rent for
at least thirty taels a year.

08:15.750 --> 08:17.000
But now you're asking only five.

08:17.010 --> 08:19.608
When something seems too good
to be true, something must be wrong.

08:19.610 --> 08:20.640
Such an incredible bargain

08:20.650 --> 08:21.880
is more than we dare accept.

08:22.240 --> 08:23.360
Exactly.

08:23.879 --> 08:24.679
We won't

08:24.680 --> 08:26.719
risk a huge loss just to save a little.

08:27.240 --> 08:28.479
If you ask me,

08:28.480 --> 08:29.078
this...

08:29.079 --> 08:30.480
this house

08:31.079 --> 08:33.518
either someone died here
and it's an ill-fated house,

08:33.519 --> 08:34.758
or the owner

08:34.759 --> 08:36.359
must be mixed up in some trouble.

08:36.360 --> 08:38.798
Do you take us for fools?

08:38.799 --> 08:40.199
- Let's go.
- Wait.

08:42.559 --> 08:43.959
We can still discuss it.

08:43.960 --> 08:45.599
Let's talk it over.

08:57.759 --> 09:00.599
How am I supposed to answer to Jiugao?

09:15.799 --> 09:16.760
Young Master.

09:17.639 --> 09:19.719
I failed to settle
the matter for Lanxiang.

09:20.720 --> 09:22.760
Not only did I fail
to rent out the house,

09:23.440 --> 09:24.800
but I also scared them away.

09:26.679 --> 09:28.560
Did you find some fierce-looking broker?

09:29.039 --> 09:30.359
I wouldn't dare.

09:30.632 --> 09:31.790
You specifically told me

09:31.799 --> 09:33.119
to find someone friendly.

09:33.240 --> 09:35.999
Broker Liu is round and jolly,

09:36.000 --> 09:37.560
always smiling.

09:37.960 --> 09:39.719
He's warm and friendly.

09:41.559 --> 09:42.719
But...

09:44.279 --> 09:45.959
Far too warm and friendly.

09:48.399 --> 09:50.320
The annual rent was only...

09:53.559 --> 09:54.800
Five taels of silver?

10:00.759 --> 10:02.359
Five taels of silver...

10:10.240 --> 10:12.800
How gullible would Lanxiang have to be

10:13.240 --> 10:15.160
to fall for a trick like that?

10:16.799 --> 10:18.079
You're right, Young Master.

10:18.440 --> 10:20.010
Lanxiang is anything but gullible.

10:20.020 --> 10:21.450
She grabbed Uncle Xu and the others

10:21.460 --> 10:22.879
and ran off without looking back.

10:39.399 --> 10:42.079
We need to find a decent house,

10:42.200 --> 10:44.640
but one that's not
quite as good as today's,

10:45.919 --> 10:47.640
so she won't get suspicious.

10:48.159 --> 10:49.398
Finding a house better

10:49.399 --> 10:50.758
than the one today would be easy.

10:50.759 --> 10:52.680
Finding a worse one won't be.

10:57.159 --> 10:58.479
"If you know it won't be easy,

10:58.559 --> 10:59.760
then get going."

11:00.759 --> 11:01.798
I'll go right away.

11:01.799 --> 11:02.719
Right away.

11:09.080 --> 11:10.879
She's far too shrewd

11:11.279 --> 11:12.879
to be easily fooled.

11:13.200 --> 11:16.680
She's bound to be
quite a handful in the future.

11:22.399 --> 11:23.518
Here, sir. Have some tea.

11:23.519 --> 11:25.678
This job doesn't look suitable.

11:25.679 --> 11:26.199
Forget it.

11:26.200 --> 11:27.440
Let's look somewhere else.

11:31.720 --> 11:32.678
Father.

11:32.679 --> 11:33.560
Mother.

11:34.120 --> 11:34.959
Here's a job posting.

11:34.960 --> 11:36.878
(Job Posting)

11:36.879 --> 11:38.000
I know about this one.

11:38.010 --> 11:39.839
The notice has been
up for over six months,

11:39.840 --> 11:41.719
and they haven't hired a single person.

11:41.720 --> 11:44.638
I heard the owner of this shop

11:44.639 --> 11:46.560
has a very peculiar temper.

11:46.600 --> 11:48.999
He even judges applicants
by their looks.

11:49.159 --> 11:50.878
If he doesn't like the look of someone,

11:50.879 --> 11:52.560
he throws them right out.

11:53.919 --> 11:54.918
And there's this.

11:54.919 --> 11:55.999
Look.

11:56.240 --> 11:57.920
Wages negotiable.

11:59.320 --> 12:01.319
People who can read cursive script

12:01.320 --> 12:04.400
go in eagerly to discuss
the wages with him.

12:04.480 --> 12:06.199
Guess what he tells them.

12:06.600 --> 12:08.119
Not a penny.

12:08.120 --> 12:11.680
He says they'll split the profits evenly
once the shop makes money.

12:11.759 --> 12:14.239
Isn't that just getting people
to work for free?

12:16.559 --> 12:17.560
Father.

12:18.039 --> 12:19.199
If the shop makes no money,

12:19.200 --> 12:20.450
then they'd be working for free.

12:20.460 --> 12:21.758
But if the shop makes money,

12:21.759 --> 12:23.640
then it wouldn't be for nothing.

12:23.799 --> 12:24.999
If the shop

12:25.000 --> 12:26.479
can make two taels a month,

12:26.480 --> 12:27.918
and I split it evenly with the owner,

12:27.919 --> 12:29.400
I'd get one tael.

12:29.679 --> 12:30.439
There.

12:30.440 --> 12:31.800
Lodging is included.

12:32.519 --> 12:35.079
(Lodging Included)
If you work it out, the pay isn't low.

12:36.639 --> 12:38.079
Silly girl.

12:38.080 --> 12:40.518
Money isn't that easy to make.

12:40.519 --> 12:42.710
If it really were that easy,
why did all the assistants

12:42.720 --> 12:44.518
and shopkeepers
who worked here before leave?

12:44.519 --> 12:45.680
They all quit.

12:47.519 --> 12:48.359
Let's go.

12:48.360 --> 12:50.599
We'll find another broker
and look at more houses.

12:52.200 --> 12:53.160
Father.

12:53.879 --> 12:55.599
What do you think of this handwriting?

12:58.320 --> 13:01.079
I didn't see much cursive script
at the shop before,

13:01.080 --> 13:02.479
so I can't really tell.

13:03.320 --> 13:04.440
But

13:05.240 --> 13:07.040
the handwriting

13:07.600 --> 13:09.119
seems quite good.

13:09.519 --> 13:11.680
Let's go meet the person who wrote it.

13:12.080 --> 13:12.918
All right.

13:12.919 --> 13:13.798
Let's meet him.

13:13.799 --> 13:14.398
Come on.

13:14.399 --> 13:15.400
Come on, Mother.

13:16.039 --> 13:17.160
You two...

13:31.559 --> 13:32.719
Father.

13:39.399 --> 13:40.599
Is anyone here?

13:43.600 --> 13:45.079
We're coming in.

13:45.240 --> 13:46.599
Is that all right?

13:46.600 --> 13:48.440
The door isn't locked.

13:49.840 --> 13:51.359
We're coming in.

13:53.440 --> 13:54.599
Is anyone here?

13:57.840 --> 13:58.959
Father.

14:07.759 --> 14:08.800
Is anyone...

14:10.159 --> 14:11.440
You are...

14:12.180 --> 14:13.558
(Tu Wu, longtime servant
of the Lu family)

14:13.559 --> 14:15.199
We saw

14:15.200 --> 14:18.199
the job notice outside
the painting and calligraphy shop.

14:20.639 --> 14:21.760
Come in.

14:36.519 --> 14:37.640
Seventh Master.

14:39.279 --> 14:40.400
Seventh Master.

14:43.759 --> 14:44.758
(Lu Xie)
Seventh Master.

14:44.759 --> 14:46.599
(Courtesy name Hezhi, art name Zongbai)
Someone's here looking for work.

14:46.900 --> 14:51.140
(Han Liang, courtesy name Yizhen)

14:58.200 --> 14:59.359
Mister Lu.

14:59.672 --> 15:01.680
The owner of the painting
and calligraphy shop.

15:04.360 --> 15:05.440
Mister Lu.

15:07.039 --> 15:08.520
Greetings, Mister Lu.

15:28.559 --> 15:30.158
A good father, a good mother.

15:30.159 --> 15:32.560
You've raised a fine daughter.

15:33.840 --> 15:35.678
This family will do.

15:35.679 --> 15:36.719
You're hired.

15:41.360 --> 15:42.680
Please follow me.

16:01.279 --> 16:02.999
These two adjoining courtyards

16:03.000 --> 16:04.479
both belong to the Lu family.

16:04.480 --> 16:06.640
Seventh Master lives in the eastern one.

16:06.679 --> 16:07.878
You'll live in the western one.

16:07.879 --> 16:10.040
You'll be in charge
of the day-to-day business.

16:10.320 --> 16:12.040
The accounts
will be settled once a month.

16:13.159 --> 16:16.079
Scholar Han
and his mother live over there.

16:16.440 --> 16:19.199
You've already met Scholar Han.

16:19.200 --> 16:20.599
He's learned and courteous.

16:20.639 --> 16:23.040
If there's anything you don't
understand, you can go ask him.

16:23.679 --> 16:24.959
Get settled in first.

16:24.960 --> 16:26.158
I have work to do.

16:26.159 --> 16:27.280
Thank you.

16:40.600 --> 16:41.719
Three rooms.

16:41.720 --> 16:43.680
That's enough for the three of us.

16:45.960 --> 16:49.239
This courtyard may look a little old,

16:49.679 --> 16:51.239
but it's actually well built.

16:52.159 --> 16:52.918
Look.

16:52.919 --> 16:54.558
Even these floor tiles

16:54.559 --> 16:56.479
are made of fine materials.

16:56.559 --> 16:57.758
I'll tidy everything up later.

16:57.759 --> 17:00.440
Once we have it all arranged,
it'll be a nice place to live.

17:01.519 --> 17:02.640
I'll take

17:02.919 --> 17:04.199
this job?

17:04.519 --> 17:06.278
It's just that without a fixed wage,

17:06.279 --> 17:08.159
I can't help feeling a little uneasy.

17:08.920 --> 17:10.278
There may be no fixed wage,

17:10.279 --> 17:11.919
but at least
we won't have to spend money

17:11.920 --> 17:13.399
renting a place elsewhere.

17:13.559 --> 17:15.078
And all our neighbors

17:15.079 --> 17:16.639
are scholarly families.

17:16.640 --> 17:18.838
Nothing was stolen
even with the shop left open.

17:18.839 --> 17:19.800
That shows

17:19.839 --> 17:21.079
it's safe around here.

17:22.319 --> 17:24.959
Mister Lu seems quite amiable.

17:24.960 --> 17:26.639
And Scholar Han

17:26.640 --> 17:28.199
doesn't put on airs at all.

17:28.200 --> 17:29.919
He seems easy to get along with.

17:31.680 --> 17:33.358
What did Mister Lu say just now?

17:33.359 --> 17:34.598
I didn't understand him.

17:34.599 --> 17:35.798
He's a fortune-teller.

17:35.799 --> 17:37.240
He can read faces, right?

17:39.119 --> 17:40.439
He said

17:41.160 --> 17:43.159
Father and Mother love me dearly

17:43.160 --> 17:44.639
and raised me well.

17:44.640 --> 17:46.599
He was saying how capable you both are.

17:53.160 --> 17:55.558
We won't touch
a penny of Lanxiang's money.

17:55.559 --> 17:57.838
Your father and I
have saved a few dozen taels.

17:57.839 --> 17:59.480
If we're careful with our spending,

18:00.160 --> 18:01.800
we'll manage just fine.

18:01.839 --> 18:03.359
Why don't we give it a try?

18:04.480 --> 18:06.079
All right, let's give it a try.

18:07.279 --> 18:09.359
We're moving into a new home!

18:12.759 --> 18:14.359
Look at you jumping for joy,

18:14.720 --> 18:16.280
just like a little girl.

18:17.700 --> 18:23.340
(Lu Family Painting
and Calligraphy Shop)

18:24.300 --> 18:29.700
♪Through rise and fall, people meet
and part as they always do♪

18:31.759 --> 18:33.518
Put it there and take a break.

18:33.519 --> 18:34.439
I'll do it in a bit.

18:34.440 --> 18:35.879
It's fine. Take it easy.

18:35.880 --> 18:37.280
Put it in the back room first.

18:39.220 --> 18:42.379
♪Plum blossoms bloom,
enduring the frost♪

18:42.380 --> 18:47.939
♪Yet their proud spirit fades
with wind and snow♪

18:47.940 --> 18:51.419
♪Bamboo shadows
embrace quiet contentment♪

18:51.420 --> 18:54.379
♪Only orchids dwell in secluded places♪

18:54.380 --> 19:00.460
♪Watching the old
and new take turns in this world♪

19:03.279 --> 19:04.318
Don't move it. Don't.

19:04.319 --> 19:05.240
I'll do it.

19:05.319 --> 19:06.520
I know.

19:09.400 --> 19:10.679
Come on. Let's do it together.

19:10.839 --> 19:12.318
Don't move. All right. That's good.

19:12.319 --> 19:13.480
Move it back a little.

19:13.759 --> 19:14.839
Good. That's fine.

19:16.500 --> 19:25.580
♪I read every joy
and sorrow behind the curtain♪

19:37.920 --> 19:39.278
This dish is really well made.

19:39.279 --> 19:40.639
That's everything.

19:41.200 --> 19:42.598
You all go get some rest.

19:42.599 --> 19:43.520
All right.

19:45.039 --> 19:46.159
Granny Du.

19:46.160 --> 19:48.558
You're the eldest here.
Please take the seat of honor.

19:48.559 --> 19:50.558
You're our host today.

19:50.559 --> 19:51.798
You should sit first.

19:51.799 --> 19:52.919
Sit.

19:53.759 --> 19:54.479
Come on.

19:54.480 --> 19:55.318
Everyone have a seat.

19:55.319 --> 19:56.320
Have a seat.

19:57.000 --> 19:58.119
Let's all sit down.

19:58.200 --> 19:58.919
All right.

19:59.119 --> 19:59.839
Good.

20:01.240 --> 20:01.959
Come on.

20:01.960 --> 20:02.810
Sit.

20:02.820 --> 20:03.719
Mother, come quickly.

20:03.720 --> 20:04.760
Come on.

20:07.920 --> 20:10.879
Today we're celebrating Lanxiang and
her family moving into their new home.

20:10.880 --> 20:13.159
As the eldest here,
I'll say a few words first.

20:14.359 --> 20:17.159
May your family's life grow more
prosperous with each passing day.

20:17.160 --> 20:18.240
May you prosper.

20:19.000 --> 20:19.999
May you prosper.

20:20.000 --> 20:22.540
- Congratulations.
- Congratulations.

20:25.039 --> 20:25.679
Let's eat.

20:25.680 --> 20:26.719
Let's eat.

20:26.720 --> 20:27.839
Let's eat.

20:28.200 --> 20:29.119
Try this.

20:32.480 --> 20:33.538
Lanxiang.

20:33.539 --> 20:34.558
(Du Dasong, Du Xiaolian's older brother)

20:34.559 --> 20:36.800
How does it feel
living in your new home?

20:39.559 --> 20:41.358
My mother couldn't bear
to leave Granny Du,

20:41.359 --> 20:43.560
Aunt Chen, or Aunt Liu.

20:44.599 --> 20:46.639
Wenchang Street
isn't far from here either.

20:46.680 --> 20:49.100
When we go grocery shopping,
we can stop by while we're out.

20:49.112 --> 20:51.879
Don't get tired of me
coming over for tea all the time.

20:51.880 --> 20:53.800
Of course not.

20:53.960 --> 20:55.910
Whenever you feel
like going back for a visit,

20:55.920 --> 20:57.359
just go.

20:57.496 --> 20:58.910
And if you ever run into trouble,

20:58.920 --> 21:01.280
don't treat us like outsiders.

21:02.079 --> 21:03.719
We may not be capable of much,

21:03.720 --> 21:05.679
but if you need help carrying things

21:05.680 --> 21:06.960
or a few people to back you up,

21:07.200 --> 21:09.399
we can certainly lend a hand.

21:09.680 --> 21:10.960
My mother is right.

21:11.310 --> 21:13.000
My sister Xiaolian is rather naive.

21:13.064 --> 21:14.630
Thanks to Lanxiang looking out for her,

21:14.640 --> 21:16.390
she's been able
to get by without trouble.

21:16.408 --> 21:17.720
Whatever happens in the future,

21:18.039 --> 21:18.758
Uncle Xu,

21:18.759 --> 21:19.639
just call on me.

21:21.160 --> 21:21.999
Dasong is right.

21:22.000 --> 21:22.999
Just call on us.

21:23.000 --> 21:23.800
All right.

21:24.400 --> 21:25.318
Let's have a toast.

21:25.319 --> 21:26.959
Come on.

21:26.960 --> 21:27.679
Let's drink.

21:27.680 --> 21:28.758
Let's drink.

21:28.759 --> 21:29.679
Come on.

21:29.680 --> 21:30.479
Eat up.

21:30.480 --> 21:31.159
Good.

21:31.160 --> 21:32.399
Help yourselves.

21:32.440 --> 21:33.598
Don't be shy.

21:33.600 --> 21:35.528
Since you're here,
make yourselves at home.

21:36.079 --> 21:37.760
Try my cooking.

21:39.040 --> 21:40.110
Have some more to drink.

21:40.119 --> 21:41.520
Eat some more.

21:44.519 --> 21:45.598
Watch your step.

21:45.599 --> 21:46.879
I am.

21:46.880 --> 21:48.598
I'm not even drunk.

21:48.599 --> 21:50.399
I'm just so happy today.

21:50.400 --> 21:51.278
All right.

21:51.279 --> 21:53.358
Let me enjoy myself.

21:53.359 --> 21:55.639
I'm really not drunk.

21:55.720 --> 21:56.639
Lie down.

21:56.720 --> 21:57.839
Over there.

21:58.119 --> 21:59.079
Lie down.

21:59.920 --> 22:01.800
All right. Go to sleep.

22:03.680 --> 22:05.520
Look at him.

22:05.799 --> 22:06.919
He's that happy.

22:33.680 --> 22:35.960
I truly never dreamed

22:37.920 --> 22:39.159
that in this lifetime,

22:39.839 --> 22:41.399
I'd get to live in such a nice house.

22:41.400 --> 22:43.879
Look how easily pleased your mother is.

22:44.160 --> 22:47.200
I'll get you
an even better house someday.

22:51.640 --> 22:53.040
Your father is right.

22:54.079 --> 22:55.879
Once we've saved enough money,

22:55.880 --> 22:57.159
we'll buy a home of our own

22:57.160 --> 22:58.599
and our own land.

22:59.319 --> 23:00.399
Really?

23:00.400 --> 23:02.479
Of course it's true.

23:02.480 --> 23:04.479
Why are you getting up again?

23:04.480 --> 23:05.879
Where are you going?

23:07.000 --> 23:08.599
What are you looking for?

23:10.400 --> 23:11.479
Hold on to it.

23:11.480 --> 23:13.239
Look carefully.

23:13.240 --> 23:13.790
Give it to me.

23:13.800 --> 23:17.000
We're registered free commoners now.

23:17.079 --> 23:19.838
- All right.
- We can buy whatever we want.

23:19.839 --> 23:20.318
All right.

23:20.319 --> 23:21.639
- Right.
- Isn't it?

23:23.680 --> 23:24.919
Free commoners.

23:24.920 --> 23:26.118
This free commoner should sleep.

23:26.119 --> 23:26.719
All right.

23:26.720 --> 23:28.040
I am going to sleep.

23:37.920 --> 23:39.040
Tell me.

23:44.880 --> 23:46.040
Tell me

23:47.079 --> 23:49.599
what all this says.

23:56.839 --> 23:58.758
This is the head of the household.

23:58.759 --> 24:00.520
Father's name.

24:01.319 --> 24:03.358
(Xu Wanquan)
Xu Wanquan.

24:03.359 --> 24:04.480
Right.

24:04.559 --> 24:05.838
Registered as free commoners.

24:05.839 --> 24:07.879
Three people in the household.

24:07.880 --> 24:09.639
One male.

24:09.640 --> 24:11.119
An adult.

24:11.279 --> 24:13.479
Two females.

24:13.480 --> 24:16.879
That's Mother and me.

24:20.680 --> 24:22.118
Then what do

24:22.119 --> 24:23.480
these three characters say?

24:24.480 --> 24:26.359
No property.

24:26.440 --> 24:29.758
It means we don't own a house yet

24:29.759 --> 24:31.358
or any land.

24:31.359 --> 24:32.960
So if we

24:33.440 --> 24:34.719
really save enough money someday,

24:34.720 --> 24:36.119
can we buy our own house

24:36.160 --> 24:37.320
and land?

24:37.640 --> 24:38.480
Yes.

24:43.880 --> 24:44.919
What about an ox?

24:45.480 --> 24:47.000
Can we buy an ox?

24:47.400 --> 24:48.399
Yes.

24:49.359 --> 24:50.480
We can.

25:01.319 --> 25:02.560
That's wonderful.

25:31.839 --> 25:33.679
Thank you
for your blessings, Bodhisattva.

25:34.200 --> 25:36.639
Please keep
my whole family safe and well.

25:38.720 --> 25:39.959
Bodhisattva, please bless us.

25:39.960 --> 25:41.439
Please bless our Lanxiang

25:41.440 --> 25:43.839
with a good husband someday,

25:44.720 --> 25:47.520
one who is educated and literate

25:47.839 --> 25:49.320
and cherishes her.

25:50.359 --> 25:51.760
Bodhisattva, please bless him

25:52.039 --> 25:53.558
with good looks

25:53.559 --> 25:55.079
and good health.

25:55.319 --> 25:57.200
Thank you
for your blessings, Bodhisattva.

25:58.960 --> 26:00.639
Thank you
for your blessings, Bodhisattva.

26:02.680 --> 26:04.599
(Now that my parents are healthy)

26:05.039 --> 26:06.480
(and our family is together,)

26:07.599 --> 26:09.520
(I ask for nothing more.)

26:11.720 --> 26:13.520
(We'll live our lives well)

26:14.359 --> 26:16.439
(and be worthy
of the Bodhisattva's blessings.)

26:26.280 --> 26:27.960
Once we traced it
to Liang Yu and Dai Rong,

26:27.976 --> 26:29.848
it became difficult
to investigate any further.

26:29.920 --> 26:31.520
Those two insist

26:31.816 --> 26:33.310
that they colluded with the Wo pirates

26:33.319 --> 26:34.639
for personal gain.

26:35.112 --> 26:36.910
Duke Xianguo
was ready to close the case,

26:36.920 --> 26:38.456
but the Crown Prince suddenly ordered

26:38.472 --> 26:39.630
the interrogation to continue.

26:40.000 --> 26:41.520
I was actually relieved

26:41.599 --> 26:42.999
to have the Crown Prince's order,

26:43.000 --> 26:45.520
thinking I could uncover
whoever was behind them.

26:46.680 --> 26:47.480
But...

26:48.799 --> 26:51.038
The prison at our Rear Military Command

26:51.039 --> 26:53.079
really does have ears everywhere.

26:53.160 --> 26:54.888
There's no way
to guard against them all.

26:55.896 --> 26:58.552
Dai Rong and Liang Yu
signed confessions in blood.

26:58.696 --> 27:01.710
His Majesty reprimanded Dai Qing for
failing to keep his household in order,

27:01.720 --> 27:04.152
demoted him by two ranks
and withheld his salary for a year.

27:04.200 --> 27:06.888
This case can only be closed
with Liang Yu and Dai Rong

27:07.000 --> 27:09.830
convicted of taking bribes, leaving
the country without authorization,

27:09.880 --> 27:11.879
and illegally going to sea.

27:14.160 --> 27:16.719
Liang Yu was a Third-Rank Commander,

27:16.720 --> 27:18.399
and Dai Rong a Sixth-Rank Registrar.

27:18.400 --> 27:20.399
How could they have gotten
through many checkpoints

27:20.400 --> 27:22.399
and made so many people
risk their lives for them?

27:26.400 --> 27:27.879
His Majesty is in poor health,

27:28.319 --> 27:30.038
and undercurrents are stirring at court.

27:30.039 --> 27:32.038
His Majesty doesn't
want to make matters worse,

27:32.040 --> 27:34.392
so he can only let the case end
without getting to the truth.

27:38.680 --> 27:40.630
No wonder Crown Prince
decided to come to Jinling

27:40.640 --> 27:42.650
to offer sacrifices
to Heaven and pray for blessings.

27:46.319 --> 27:47.439
Back then,

27:48.559 --> 27:50.000
too much blood was shed,

27:51.400 --> 27:52.839
and too many died unjustly.

28:06.039 --> 28:07.358
Whether thunder or gentle rain,

28:07.359 --> 28:09.040
all are the sovereign's grace.

28:21.839 --> 28:23.359
Young Master is in a bad mood.

28:23.440 --> 28:24.399
Is it because

28:24.400 --> 28:26.679
I didn't handle
Lanxiang's matter properly?

28:30.160 --> 28:31.399
You're overthinking it.

28:33.000 --> 28:34.439
Seeing Young Master like this,

28:34.440 --> 28:35.919
how could I not overthink it?

28:48.824 --> 28:50.696
(Lu Family Painting and Calligraphy Shop)
This is the painting

28:50.700 --> 28:52.632
and calligraphy shop
where Uncle Xu works now.

28:52.664 --> 28:53.790
His family lives

28:53.799 --> 28:55.399
in the small courtyard behind the shop.

29:03.128 --> 29:04.760
These flowers are beautifully arranged.

29:05.039 --> 29:07.159
It's as if whoever did this
had been formally trained.

29:21.000 --> 29:21.639
Look.

29:21.640 --> 29:23.240
This sachet is so distinctive.

29:24.888 --> 29:26.360
It even has laurels embroidered on it.

29:26.550 --> 29:27.590
Sorry to keep you waiting.

29:27.599 --> 29:29.079
An auspicious sign.

29:35.200 --> 29:36.359
Sir, you...

29:44.599 --> 29:45.520
Young Master.

29:48.030 --> 29:49.608
- It seems...
- Shopkeeper.

29:49.688 --> 29:51.390
How much are these
two sachets with laurels?

29:51.400 --> 29:52.870
Could you work out the price for me?

29:54.120 --> 29:56.150
I'm just looking around.
Go ahead with your work.

29:56.160 --> 29:56.558
Then...

29:56.559 --> 29:57.959
I'll be right back.

29:57.960 --> 29:59.359
Feel free to look around.

30:00.039 --> 30:01.159
Here.

30:06.720 --> 30:07.999
Would you like both of these?

30:08.000 --> 30:08.919
Both.

30:09.079 --> 30:11.038
2.1 coins each.

30:11.039 --> 30:13.118
That's 4.2 coins altogether.

30:13.119 --> 30:13.679
Certainly.

30:13.680 --> 30:29.420
♪Who dares say wealth and honor
will last a hundred years?♪

30:29.440 --> 30:31.879
Lanxiang has really
been hiding her talents.

30:32.079 --> 30:34.038
She plays the sanxian well
and sings even better.

30:34.039 --> 30:40.940
♪Who dares say how many generations
will live in poverty?♪

30:41.420 --> 30:47.859
♪Who dares say who will die first♪

30:47.860 --> 30:51.259
♪Or live to a hundred?♪

30:51.260 --> 30:54.920
♪Who dares say a couple
will grow old together♪

30:54.930 --> 30:58.270
♪With their children seeing them off?♪

30:58.279 --> 30:59.999
Uncle Xu's current employer

31:00.000 --> 31:01.599
is Lu Xie,

31:01.920 --> 31:03.760
courtesy name Hezhi, art name Zongbai.

31:05.160 --> 31:06.480
He was named Third Place Scholar

31:06.559 --> 31:07.599
by the deposed emperor.

31:07.720 --> 31:09.798
His temperament
became eccentric and unconventional.

31:09.800 --> 31:12.680
He refuses to marry or take office,
preferring the company of performers

31:12.728 --> 31:14.200
and composing melodies and lyrics.

31:15.599 --> 31:18.159
Lanxiang is probably
helping Mister Zongbai

31:18.160 --> 31:19.560
transcribe songs and lyrics.

31:22.200 --> 31:23.000
That person?

31:30.839 --> 31:31.879
I don't know.

31:32.792 --> 31:33.990
I'll look into it right away.

31:34.000 --> 31:40.099
♪Who dares say?♪

31:40.100 --> 31:48.219
♪No one dares say♪

31:48.220 --> 31:58.700
♪No one dares say♪

32:03.460 --> 32:07.100
(No One Dares Say)

32:11.680 --> 32:12.480
Come.

32:24.880 --> 32:27.399
Young Master...

32:33.200 --> 32:35.318
No wonder the magpies
have been chirping all day.

32:35.320 --> 32:36.696
Please have a seat, Young Master.

32:37.039 --> 32:37.879
No need.

32:39.440 --> 32:41.078
Mother, boil some water.

32:41.079 --> 32:42.520
Make Young Master a pot of tea.

32:46.839 --> 32:47.839
Young Master.

32:47.880 --> 32:49.278
This is Scholar Han.

32:49.279 --> 32:50.679
He lives next door to us.

32:51.279 --> 32:53.199
And this is our former master,

32:53.200 --> 32:54.600
Young Master of the Lin Residence.

32:56.600 --> 32:58.030
Please sit for a while, Young Master.

32:58.039 --> 32:59.200
I'll make some tea.

33:15.759 --> 33:18.000
No wonder you have
such a distinguished bearing.

33:18.319 --> 33:20.200
So you're Assistant Commander Lin,

33:20.248 --> 33:21.800
accomplished in both letters and arms.

33:23.000 --> 33:25.639
Next year is
the triennial provincial examination.

33:25.839 --> 33:28.280
Aren't you preparing
for the provincial examination?

33:28.880 --> 33:30.239
Mister Lu has trouble with his hand

33:30.240 --> 33:31.560
and finds it difficult to write.

33:31.599 --> 33:33.919
so he hired me
to transcribe lyrics and songs.

33:34.400 --> 33:37.720
That way, I can earn some money
to help support my family.

33:38.039 --> 33:40.199
Now I need to prepare
for the provincial examination,

33:40.200 --> 33:42.376
but I've been worried
I couldn't manage everything.

33:43.519 --> 33:45.639
Fortunately, Lanxiang is here.

33:46.039 --> 33:47.239
Once I hand everything

33:47.240 --> 33:48.520
over to Lanxiang,

33:49.240 --> 33:51.119
I can focus on preparing
for the examination.

33:53.400 --> 33:54.359
Lanxiang.

33:54.720 --> 33:55.919
No need to fuss.

33:56.120 --> 33:57.710
I just came to see how you're doing.

33:57.720 --> 33:59.352
I'll sit for a while and then leave.

34:00.720 --> 34:01.599
Go ahead.

34:11.559 --> 34:12.558
The tea isn't very good.

34:12.559 --> 34:14.640
Please have some anyway, Young Master.

34:16.719 --> 34:18.640
You've been to military camps before.

34:18.920 --> 34:21.720
A soldier isn't so delicate.

34:22.679 --> 34:24.839
One who can endure hardship
and enjoy good fortune

34:24.840 --> 34:26.200
is a true hero.

34:33.400 --> 34:34.518
Don't stand.

34:34.519 --> 34:35.640
Sit down and let's talk.

34:45.752 --> 34:47.910
How is business at
the painting and calligraphy shop?

34:49.360 --> 34:50.600
Not very good.

34:50.760 --> 34:51.439
However,

34:51.440 --> 34:53.799
the brush cases, sachets,
and other things my mother makes

34:53.800 --> 34:55.519
have been quite popular.

34:57.320 --> 34:59.319
And thanks to Scholar Han,

34:59.320 --> 35:01.839
I was recommended to Mister Lu
to transcribe songs and lyrics

35:01.840 --> 35:03.399
and can earn some wages.

35:03.400 --> 35:05.038
With all that added together,

35:05.039 --> 35:06.320
we're getting by.

35:06.840 --> 35:08.080
I can't take the credit.

35:08.239 --> 35:11.839
It's because Lanxiang is literate
and well-versed in music

35:11.840 --> 35:14.320
that Mister Lu took notice of her.

35:18.280 --> 35:19.760
You're well-versed in music?

35:20.480 --> 35:22.320
Scholar Han gives me too much credit.

35:22.360 --> 35:24.238
I'm learning as I go

35:24.239 --> 35:25.959
and doing the best I can.

35:26.199 --> 35:28.238
Lanxiang is exceptionally
quick to learn.

35:28.240 --> 35:29.820
She understands as soon as she's shown.

35:30.000 --> 35:32.080
That's because Scholar Han
is a good teacher.

35:51.119 --> 35:52.238
My writing isn't good yet.

35:52.239 --> 35:53.439
Once I've improved,

35:53.440 --> 35:54.800
I'll show it to you, Young Master.

35:58.840 --> 35:59.760
All right.

36:00.000 --> 36:01.519
I'll look at it

36:01.599 --> 36:02.720
once you've improved.

36:04.600 --> 36:06.590
I still have some matters
to attend to at home,

36:06.599 --> 36:07.919
so I'll take my leave.

36:07.920 --> 36:10.240
I'll let you catch up.

36:13.320 --> 36:13.839
Mother.

36:13.840 --> 36:15.320
See Scholar Han out.

36:18.719 --> 36:19.319
Oh, right.

36:19.320 --> 36:21.518
Madam Han wanted
your embroidery patterns.

36:21.519 --> 36:23.078
I'll take them over while I'm there.

36:23.079 --> 36:23.879
All right.

36:25.840 --> 36:26.720
Let's go.

36:27.000 --> 36:27.718
Young Master.

36:27.720 --> 36:29.016
Please make yourself comfortable.

36:32.840 --> 36:33.959
How about this one?

36:35.760 --> 36:36.359
This one.

36:36.360 --> 36:37.359
Careful.

36:40.400 --> 36:41.720
They're all good.

36:46.599 --> 36:47.399
Young Master.

36:47.400 --> 36:48.359
Have some tea.

36:49.159 --> 36:49.999
All right.

36:53.400 --> 36:54.640
It seems

36:55.679 --> 36:57.120
you're doing quite well.

36:58.400 --> 36:59.279
We've been fortunate

36:59.280 --> 37:01.479
to find a good employer
and good neighbors.

37:03.480 --> 37:05.279
I was thinking that after we settled in,

37:05.280 --> 37:07.399
Mother and I could make
some fashionable trinkets

37:07.400 --> 37:08.792
and send them to the Lin Residence

37:08.824 --> 37:10.680
for First Madam
and the young ladies to enjoy.

37:10.719 --> 37:13.760
I didn't expect you
to come see us first.

37:16.119 --> 37:17.519
Since you left,

37:19.280 --> 37:20.600
Yuchan and the others

37:21.320 --> 37:22.760
have been thinking about you.

37:23.360 --> 37:25.039
Have you ever missed

37:25.416 --> 37:26.792
your days at the Lin Residence?

37:28.320 --> 37:29.279
Of course I miss

37:29.280 --> 37:30.839
Yuchan and the others.

37:30.840 --> 37:32.118
As long as our bond remains,

37:32.119 --> 37:33.638
distance cannot keep us apart.

37:33.639 --> 37:36.200
Besides, we're only a few streets away.

37:39.000 --> 37:40.479
From the looks of it,

37:40.679 --> 37:42.600
you're having the time of your life.

37:42.880 --> 37:44.720
I doubt you've given them a thought.

37:45.360 --> 37:46.479
All right.

37:46.880 --> 37:48.879
I don't want to hear
any more of your sweet talk.

37:48.880 --> 37:49.919
I'm leaving.

37:51.119 --> 37:52.078
Young Master.

37:52.079 --> 37:53.879
I really wasn't lying.

37:54.159 --> 37:56.479
I just feel
we have plenty of time ahead,

37:56.480 --> 37:58.598
and we're all still in Jinling City.

37:58.599 --> 37:59.638
As long as we care,

37:59.639 --> 38:01.200
our bond will never be broken.

38:05.840 --> 38:08.760
Now that's something I like to hear.

38:09.599 --> 38:10.999
As long as we care,

38:13.159 --> 38:14.399
our bond will never be broken.

38:27.920 --> 38:29.120
You

38:29.840 --> 38:32.120
really are like wild grass.

38:32.840 --> 38:35.200
You thrive wherever you are.

38:38.599 --> 38:40.680
It's just these butterflies
that are annoying,

38:41.559 --> 38:43.120
fluttering around

38:47.320 --> 38:48.519
and getting in the way.

38:49.360 --> 38:50.680
They're such a nuisance.

38:54.400 --> 38:55.279
Young Master.

38:55.280 --> 38:56.359
Where are the butterflies?

38:56.360 --> 38:57.760
I'll chase them out.

39:00.800 --> 39:01.759
Jiugao.

39:01.760 --> 39:03.039
Did you find out everything?

39:03.199 --> 39:04.038
Yes, Young Master.

39:04.039 --> 39:05.039
I did.

39:06.119 --> 39:07.518
Next door to Uncle Xu

39:07.519 --> 39:09.038
live Scholar Han and his mother.

39:09.040 --> 39:11.096
Scholar Han's name is Liang,
courtesy name Yizhen.

39:11.128 --> 39:12.870
After passing the county-level
examination four years ago,

39:12.880 --> 39:14.879
he moved from Suzhou
to Jinling and settled here.

39:14.880 --> 39:16.118
His father died when he was young.

39:16.120 --> 39:18.536
He also has an older sister
who married and lives in Suzhou.

39:18.616 --> 39:21.110
But her husband
died of illness six months ago.

39:21.119 --> 39:22.038
They had no children,

39:22.039 --> 39:23.279
and she's fallen on hard times.

39:23.280 --> 39:24.959
Han Liang has already hired a boat

39:24.960 --> 39:26.959
and plans to bring
his widowed sister back home.

39:35.360 --> 39:37.519
So he's not just
all looks and no substance.

39:47.039 --> 39:48.038
Young Master.

39:48.039 --> 39:49.999
Perhaps the butterfly landed somewhere.

39:50.000 --> 39:51.359
I don't hear anything.

39:56.239 --> 39:57.359
Shut up.

39:58.480 --> 39:59.118
But...

39:59.119 --> 39:59.839
Young Master.

39:59.840 --> 40:00.792
I really didn't see one.

40:00.840 --> 40:02.350
Go.

40:37.420 --> 40:43.620
(Plan before taking action,
know when to stop and you will gain.)

40:45.060 --> 40:50.620
(Six Months Later)

40:54.940 --> 40:57.638
(Jinling Imperial Palace)

40:57.639 --> 41:00.479
By the Mandate of Heaven,
the Emperor hereby decrees.

41:00.630 --> 41:02.490
(Crown Prince)
Lin Jinqi, Assistant Commander

41:02.504 --> 41:03.430
of the Shence Garrison,

41:03.440 --> 41:04.598
you have
distinguished yourself in battle

41:04.600 --> 41:06.520
and rendered meritorious service
in your duties.

41:06.568 --> 41:09.910
As you are upright in conduct,
diligent in duty, and keen in judgment,

41:09.960 --> 41:12.760
you are hereby appointed
Commander of the Shence Garrison

41:12.856 --> 41:14.184
and granted this imperial decree.

41:14.230 --> 41:15.768
May you uphold loyalty in your conduct,

41:15.816 --> 41:17.110
govern your men with benevolence,

41:17.119 --> 41:18.279
and use wisdom
to discern the slightest signs,

41:18.280 --> 41:19.518
guarding against treachery
and defending against enemies.

41:19.519 --> 41:20.919
Devote yourself to your duties

41:20.920 --> 41:22.936
and repay the imperial
favor bestowed upon you.

41:22.984 --> 41:24.320
Obey this decree with reverence.

41:25.159 --> 41:28.919
I shall faithfully fulfill my duties
and never fail His Majesty's grace.

41:37.016 --> 41:38.430
I came to Jinling by imperial decree

41:38.440 --> 41:40.700
first to pay respects
at the Sacred Ancestor's mausoleum,

41:40.720 --> 41:42.430
and second, on behalf
of my imperial father,

41:42.440 --> 41:44.860
to commend all of you who have
rendered distinguished service.

41:44.872 --> 41:45.750
You may all rise.

41:45.760 --> 41:48.328
- Long live the Crown Prince.
- Long live the Crown Prince.

41:53.208 --> 41:54.190
(Xu Guangyi, Duke Xiangguo)

41:54.199 --> 41:56.359
(Jinling Defense Commander)
Commander Lin has achieved much at such a young age.

41:56.360 --> 41:57.550
(Commander of)
This promotion

41:57.560 --> 41:59.910
(the Central Military Command)
truly has everyone's support.

41:59.920 --> 42:00.759
Indeed.

42:00.760 --> 42:01.479
That's right.

42:01.480 --> 42:02.839
Commander Xu, you flatter me.

42:02.880 --> 42:04.359
I am hardly worthy of such praise.

42:05.519 --> 42:06.638
Chengze.

42:06.639 --> 42:07.598
I hear

42:07.599 --> 42:09.519
you're going to marry
Fengtai's younger sister.

42:10.280 --> 42:12.319
Your Highness.
The wedding date has been set

42:12.320 --> 42:13.880
for the sixth day of the sixth month.

42:15.480 --> 42:16.439
I humbly dare

42:16.440 --> 42:18.904
to invite Your Highness
to join us for a celebratory drink.

42:20.159 --> 42:22.320
I wouldn't miss that wedding feast.

42:23.000 --> 42:23.999
Come to think of it,

42:24.000 --> 42:26.320
Jiarong calls me Uncle,

42:26.599 --> 42:29.080
and after the marriage,
she'll call Fengtai Uncle as well.

42:29.360 --> 42:30.678
By that reckoning,

42:30.679 --> 42:32.439
Fengtai and I

42:32.559 --> 42:34.160
will be family, too.

42:38.079 --> 42:39.359
I am deeply honored.

42:39.719 --> 42:40.680
Honored indeed.

42:40.880 --> 42:41.999
Indeed.

42:42.159 --> 42:44.919
I hear Commander Lin
has yet to take a wife.

42:44.920 --> 42:47.519
Have you arranged a marriage yet?

42:48.159 --> 42:50.158
A man like Fengtai

42:50.159 --> 42:52.320
surely wouldn't remain unattached.

42:53.519 --> 42:54.879
It's a long story.

42:55.320 --> 42:57.640
A good match has always
been ordained by Heaven.

42:57.719 --> 43:00.240
Perhaps the right time
simply hasn't come.

43:05.060 --> 43:07.660
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:09.432 --> 43:11.910
Didn't you say it blooms
at night and smells wonderful?

43:12.360 --> 43:13.640
I happened to divide the plant,

43:14.239 --> 43:15.519
so I brought you

43:15.599 --> 43:16.479
one of the new shoots.

43:22.440 --> 43:24.158
Thanks to Yuchan and Gantang.

43:24.160 --> 43:26.216
They even remembered
to bring me a potted flower.

43:45.620 --> 43:49.740
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

43:52.580 --> 43:57.100
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

43:58.380 --> 44:02.300
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:02.980 --> 44:05.740
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:06.460 --> 44:08.780
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:08.780 --> 44:11.860
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:13.380 --> 44:17.620
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:20.540 --> 44:24.700
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:26.500 --> 44:30.060
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:30.060 --> 44:33.620
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:34.420 --> 44:40.100
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:40.460 --> 44:44.780
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:45.140 --> 44:48.100
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

44:48.100 --> 44:51.860
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

44:51.860 --> 44:54.740
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

44:54.740 --> 44:58.820
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

44:58.820 --> 45:02.180
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:02.180 --> 45:05.940
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:05.940 --> 45:09.940
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

